# 🚢 Titanic Survival Prediction

Exploratory Data Analysis and Supervised Machine Learning Pipeline on the Titanic Dataset.

## 📊 Dataset & Preprocessing Steps
* **Source:** Seaborn library (`sns.load_dataset('titanic')`)
* **Imputation:** Missing `age` values filled with column mean.
* **Feature Dropping:** Excluded redundant/high-null columns (`deck`, `embark_town`, `alive`, `class`, `who`, `adult_male`).
* **Feature Scaling:** Applied `StandardScaler` for distance-based models.

## 🤖 Models Trained & Comparison

| Algorithm | Feature Scaling | Accuracy |
| :--- | :---: | :---: |
| **Support Vector Classifier (SVC)** | **Yes** | **81.46%** 🏆 |
| **Logistic Regression** | No | **80.33%** |
| **Decision Tree Classifier** | Yes | **80.33%** |
| **K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN)** | Yes | **79.21%** |
| **Gaussian Naive Bayes** | No | **77.52%** |

## 🚀 Usage
Run `TITANIC_DATASET.ipynb` in VS Code, Jupyter Notebook, or Google Colab.
